# Bot1 keeps Blightsteel Colossus with six Islands and plays no land, so on turn 3 it draws to eight and discards the
# Colossus to hand size. "If it would be put into a graveyard from anywhere" includes a hand: it is revealed and
# shuffled into Bot1's library instead, and the graveyard stays empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Blightsteel Colossus
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Discard(Blightsteel Colossus)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
